<title>USA: U.S. interest rates lower in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. interest rates lower in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve announced average interest rates for the week ended July 11, compared with the July 4 week, as follows:</p>
<p>   Federal funds rate.................5.48 vs 5.82</p>
<p>   3-month Treasury bills.............4.99 vs 5.04</p>
<p>   3-month commercial paper...........5.58 vs 5.63</p>
<p>   3-month bankers acceptances........5.54 vs 5.58</p>
<p>   3-month CDs........................5.61 vs 5.66</p>
<p>   3-month Eurodollar.................5.63 vs 5.65</p>
<p>   30-year Government bond............6.56 vs 6.72</p>
</text>
